# FreshLens — Agent Sync

Claude Code works in this same checkout. Follow [`.agents/skills/agent-sync/SKILL.md`](../../.agents/skills/agent-sync/SKILL.md):

1. Run `scripts/agent-status.sh` at the start of a session.
2. Do not edit, stage or revert uncommitted files you did not change.
3. Record your area under **Claims** in `.agents/HANDOFF.md` (local, gitignored) and move it to **Done** when finished.
4. Stage by explicit path — never `git add -A` / `git add .`. Never commit to `main`.
